        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "......."
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  But this is the only way to make her stay.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "But this is the only way to make her stay."
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  Don't forget why we formed 'Gavial's Will'!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "Don't forget why we formed 'Gavial's Will'!"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  'Gavial's Will' is not just a tribe. It is an alliance dedicated to the vision of Gavial as the Great Chief!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "'Gavial's Will' is not just a tribe. It is an alliance dedicated to the vision of Gavial as the Great Chief!"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_070\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Clan Leader B\"]  I agree with Tomimi. I'll only recognize Gavial as the Great Chief.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Clan Leader B",
        "content": "I agree with Tomimi. I'll only recognize Gavial as the Great Chief."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_071\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_071"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Clan Leader A\"]  That's right, Gavial should be the one to lead us!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Clan Leader A",
        "content": "That's right, Gavial should be the one to lead us!"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_070\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Clan Leader C\"]  Hah, if I disagreed I wouldn't be here either!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Clan Leader C",
        "content": "Hah, if I disagreed I wouldn't be here either!"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"Peta\"]  ...Peta doesn't like it, but Peta will follow.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Peta",
        "content": "...Peta doesn't like it, but Peta will follow."
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  Alright, you head over to Zumama's tribe and wait outside for me, got it?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "Alright, you head over to Zumama's tribe and wait outside for me, got it?"
