        "raw": "[name=\"Flint\"]  I felt a greater strength from her than anything I ever felt from Zumama.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Flint",
        "content": "I felt a greater strength from her than anything I ever felt from Zumama."
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"Flint\"]  I'm not interested in you anymore, Gavial. Looks like you can talk to her, so please, ask her to teach me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Flint",
        "content": "I'm not interested in you anymore, Gavial. Looks like you can talk to her, so please, ask her to teach me."
